# Anthiel backend

Use skill **`anthiel-backend`** for full procedures. This rule is ambient law.

## Module shape

Copy `apps/backend/src/modules/customers/`:

```
contracts/  routes/  services/  index.ts
```

Mount via `app.ts` → `.use(<domain>Routes(db))`.

## Routes

- Factory `(db: AppDb) => new Elysia({ prefix, name, tags })`
- Zod from contracts on query/body/response
- Thin handlers: `return unwrap(await service.method(...))`
- No Drizzle / domain txn logic in routes

## Services

- Constructor deps (`AppDb` + ports); `Promise<Result<T, ApiError>>`
- DB via `tryDb`; lists via `paginate` / `resolveOrderBy` / `ilikeContains`
- PATCH via `requireNonEmptyPatch`; prefer `.returning()` + NotFound
- No Elysia Context / Request types in public methods

## After API change

Regenerate Orval in `apps/web`, `apps/online-order`, `apps/desktop` as needed.
